/**
 * One PreToolUse process per tool call (yellow-refactor M1, phase 1).
 *
 * Today every PreToolUse call starts 3 processes for Bash, Write, Edit and
 * Read: the per-tool sync dispatcher plus lifecycle/webhook-forwarder twice
 * (the per-tool group and the matcher-less group both carry it). Measured in
 * src/hooks/docs/hook-process-measurements/2026-10-31-main.json.
 *
 * pretool/tool-dispatcher runs every ork PreToolUse handler for the tool in
 * one process and forwards the event once. It is wired only into the
 * flagged hooks.json variant (scripts/unified-pretool-hooks.mjs); the
 * shipped hooks.json is unchanged, so the default stays off.
 */

